            },
            "reviewBody": "I used this for tilapia instead of salmon. It wasn't bad but I felt like it could have benefited from additional flavors, seemed like it was missing something. Overall not bad when you need something simple in a hurry. I doubt I would use this with salmon however, it worked with the tilapia.",
